 * ░█░█░█▀█░█░█░█▀▄░█▀█░█▀▄░░░░░░░░░█▀█░█░█░█░░░█▀▀░█▀▀░█▀█░█░█░█▀▄░▀█▀░█▀█
 * ░█▄█░█▀█░░█░░█▀▄░█▀█░█▀▄░░░▄▄▄░░░█▀▀░█░█░█░░░▀▀█░█▀▀░█▀█░█░█░█░█░░█░░█░█
 * ░▀░▀░▀░▀░░▀░░▀▀░░▀░▀░▀░▀░░░░░░░░░▀░░░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀░▀░▀▀▀░▀▀░░▀▀▀░▀▀▀

 * Refer to, https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/wiki/Module:-PulseAudio
 */

{
  "pulseaudio": {
    "format": "{icon} {volume}% {format_source}", //  The format, how information should be displayed. This format is used when other formats aren't specified.
    "format-muted": " {format_source}", //  	This format is used when the sound is muted.

    "format-bluetooth": "󰂯 {volume}%  {format_source}", //  This format is used when using bluetooth speakers.
    "format-bluetooth-muted": "󰟎  {format_source}", //  This format is used when the bluetooth speaker is muted.

    "format-source": " {volume}%", //  	This format used for the source.
    "format-source-muted": "", //  This format is used when the source is muted.

    "on-click": "pavucontrol", //  Command to execute when clicked on the module.

    //  Based on the current port-name and volume, the corresponding icon gets selected. The order is low to high. See Icons
    "format-icons": {
      "default": ["", "", ""],
      "headphone": "",
      "phone": "",
      "phone-muted": "",
      "portable": "",
      "car": "",
    },
  },
}
